     "align": "center"
    }
   ],
   "speech": "Score distillation alone gives gritty images: top row, four Mikus hiding Captain Picard. So phase two: each round, we SDEdit every derived image into a cleaner target, the middle row, and regress the primes toward it with SSIM plus MSE. Our default: 500 score distillation steps, then 8 dream-target steps, with the hidden image weighted 3. Bottom row is after."
  },
